eg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_41-350x350.jpeg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_41-480x480.jpeg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-1024x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1703\" data-full-url=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40.jpeg\" data-link=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/2021\/01\/11\/wie-es-alles-begann\/wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40\/\" class=\"wp-image-1703\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-300x300.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-150x150.jpeg 150w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-768x768.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-830x830.jpeg 830w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-230x230.jpeg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-350x350.jpeg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_40-480x480.jpeg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-1024x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1702\" data-full-url=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39.jpeg\" data-link=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/2021\/01\/11\/wie-es-alles-begann\/wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39\/\" class=\"wp-image-1702\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-300x300.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-150x150.jpeg 150w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-768x768.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-830x830.jpeg 830w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-230x230.jpeg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-350x350.jpeg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_39-480x480.jpeg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In addition, we would like to establish a meadow for fruit trees in the fall of 2021. For this, 25 fruit trees are to be donated to us by a dear neighbor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Unfortunately, we could not begin with the official opening in September 2020 as desired, since legal permissions are still missing. We will keep you updated on this as we are currently working on it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We are very grateful to have had this experience and are excited to see what happens next. Also check us out on Facebook <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/LifestylecenterEyba\">(@LifestylecenterEyba) <\/a>and Instagram <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/lifestylecenter_eyba\/\">(@lifestylecenter_eyba)<\/a> to stay up to date.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Do you also want to help and support us? There are still many open &#8222;construction sites&#8220;, but things are progressing steadily. Financial contributions can make a big difference. Soon the rest of the property has to be fenced (about 6000 \u20ac) to protect the fruit trees from wild animals. Three very old gates need to be replaced (3000 \u20ac), and both ponds need restoration. The small fire pond urgently needs a new weir and the large pond is completely silted up and needs to be dredged. We are very happy if it is on your heart to support us through prayer or financial donations. We thank you very much in advance. Even small amounts can make a big difference!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Account details for donations:<br>Verein f\u00fcr Leben und Gesundheit e.V.<br>IBAN: DE96 8306 5408 0004 2421 65<br>Intended purpose: &#8222;Donation&#8220;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I am already eagerly waiting for spring to work on the garden design. But for now everything is covered with snow. This night we had -12\u00b0C &#8211; ideal weather for planning work in the house. So see you soon!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Best regards from Benni and Lydia<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-rounded\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-1024x768.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1701\" width=\"507\" height=\"381\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-300x225.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-768x576.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-1536x1152.jpeg 1536w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-830x623.jpeg 830w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-230x173.jpeg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-350x263.jpeg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31-480x360.jpeg 480w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Wire-2021-01-11-at-10_31.jpeg 1802w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 507px) 100vw, 507px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Welcome to our new blog.<br \/>\nToday I would like to take you on our journey&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1709,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[20],"tags":[55,48,47,54],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1711"}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1711"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1711\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1723,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1711\/revisions\/1723"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1709"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1711"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1711"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1711"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}